    },
    "cfg.fixed_asset.side": {
      "value": 0.032,
      "mark": "[proxy] the square pocket edge the gate tests against. The real opening is POCKET_OPENING_X x POCKET_OPENING_Y and is not square. Read by the four-corner gate; moves with the SDF rework (D-109)."
    },
    "cfg.gate_min_alignment": {
      "value": 0.99,
      "mark": "[proxy] tool-axis alignment floor, calibrated on the square peg. The real bound is D-106's across-tilt limit, which D-121 reopened and the concept stream has not recomputed."
    },
    "tasks.SIDE_CLEARANCE": {
      "value": 0.0010000000000000009,
      "mark": "[proxy] half-clearance per axis of the square pair. The real task has TWO different total plays, PLAY_X and PLAY_Y, which the report now prints instead. Kept only because compare_runs.py reads the metrics key side_clearance_mm."
    },
    "tasks.YAW_WINDOW_RAD": {
      "value": 0.06910872167872839,
      "mark": "[proxy] the C4 free-yaw window of a square in a square. The real part fits ONE way round, so there is no equivalent; D-106's yaw bound was reopened by D-121 and is not recomputed. The report no longer prints it. Kept only because compare_runs.py reads the metrics key yaw_window_deg."
    }
